<title>USA: First Bank to redeem preferred shares.</title>
<headline>First Bank to redeem preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bank System Inc said Wednesday it will redeem all outstanding shares of its $3.5625 cumulative convertible preferred stock, series 1991A.</p>
<p>The shares wil be redeemed on December 31 at a price of $52.1375 a share, it added.</p>
<p>After that date, dividends will no longer accrue and be payable on the preferred stock. First Bank will pay the dividend due on December 31, it added.</p>
<p>Each share of series 1991A preferred stock is convertible into 1.7256 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
